Extend the T3 live verifier beyond idle and active delivery: same-directory distinct-thread isolation, restart recovery, DND/stop behavior, native-child isolation, malicious-body inertness, ephemeral and deferrable mail, and unsupported adapter behavior. Keep isolated homes/process groups, sanitized evidence, exact binary hashes, and no polling false positives.

Lane decision (2026-10-17): serial after P7.M1.E1.T001 because the live verifier consumes the bridge contract and shares the T3 test harness/evidence surfaces. Keep T3 bridge fixes isolated from verifier work until the combined output budget is reviewed and landed.